  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Slavic feudal, ascending, with a Byzantine overlay at the top: Tsar (< Greek Kaisar < Caesar) is the Hellenized imperial title over the Tsarstvo, raised above the Velikii Knyaz (grand prince of Kyivgrad) and the knyazes. Boyarin (boyar-lord) barony; Posadnik (appointed town/frontier-governor) march; Namestnik (vicegerent) county; Voevoda (war-leader) duchy. The veche checks the prince. (Rank titles are the real Slavic/Greek register, allowed.)",
